# Copy this file to ".env" for local development. In CI the one key used is a repository Secret.
#
# The dashboard pipeline (freeze.py, the Refresh workflow) uses only EIA_API_KEY, to extend the
# committed EIA spot series behind the supply-shock study; without it the committed series is used
# and everything still builds. The volatility research needs no key (it runs on the pinned snapshot
# in data/market).

# https://www.eia.gov/opendata/  (also the direction backtest's optional macro features, --features all)
EIA_API_KEY=

# The keys below are read only by the retracted direction model's research code (backend/oil.py)
# when it is run locally. Production never calls these providers. NewsAPI's free Developer plan is
# licensed for development only and delays articles by 24 hours.
NEWSAPI_KEY=
FINNHUB_KEY=
ALPHA_VANTAGE_KEY=
USDA_NASS_KEY=
NOAA_CDO_KEY=
